ak → release → clean, punctuated text appears **anywhere**\\\"],[41,\\\"- Removes \\\\\\\"um\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"like\\\\\\\", all fillers automatically\\\"],[42,\\\"- Fixes grammar, can rephrase, bullet-point, or even generate text\\\"],[43,\\\"- Tiny actions already work (\\\\\\\"open YouTube\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"set 5-min timer\\\\\\\")\\\"],[44,\\\"- **Full Prompt Engineering:** Every behavior is customizable. Tweak how Jarvis formats mail, cleans dictation, or behaves as an assistant.\\\"],[45,\\\"- **Fully offline** with local **Whisper** or **NVIDIA Parakeet** (via Sherpa-ONNX)\\\"],[46,\\\"- **100% Private, Blazingly Fast** support for local LLMs via [Ollama](https://ollama.com)\\\"],[47,\\\"- Or use cloud speed with Deepgram + Gemini (1M tokens/day free) — Deepgram requests default to `mip_opt_out=true`\\\"],[48,\\\"\\\"],[49,\\\"**Zero tracking. Zero telemetry. Zero bullshit.**\\\"]],\\\"next_start\\\":50,\\\"omissions\\\":[],\\\"omitted_cards\\\":1,\\\"source_id\\\":\\\"S1\\\",\\\"start\\\":26,\\\"total_lines\\\":205,\\\"v\\\":3,\\\"view_id\\\":\\\"6e752039632cbebac84c202e2a7ae77dbf562e8c69a7e0ab6d67011edb1ff6b3\\\"}\",\"success\":true,\"tool\":\"ultima_work_research_inspect\"},\"timestamp\":1794119484.3497493,\"type\":\"tool_call_end\"}","{\"data\":{\"agent\":\"native_react\",\"arguments\":{\"source_id\":\"S1\",\"start_line\":50},\"tool\":\"ultima_work_research_inspect\"},\"timestamp\":1794119485.1390584,\"type\":\"tool_call_start\"}","{\"data\":{\"agent\":\"native_react\",\"latency\":0.005916595458984375,\"metadata\":{\"adapter_uuid\":\"36438247-862b-4a4c-87a7-0bd56485d900\",\"arguments\":{\"source_id\":\"S1\",\"start_line\":50},\"binding\":[\"af193268-f4d6-46cf-8724-f1078650a32e\",\"1373606e-4cbc-4244-93ba-7f416b36bf78\",\"1391bd35-6744-48d5-b57f-04e1b6f00d7f\"],\"dispatch_uuid\":\"5b99f98d-c55b-4e23-9b59-ca334d05b871\",\"generation\":2,\"seq\":2},\"result\":\"{\\\"cards\\\":[[\\\"N3.321fae92e927b605\\\",\\\"documented\\\",\\\"\\\",51,51,50,55],[\\\"N3.20445d