ro telemetry. Zero bullshit.**\\\\\\\"]],\\\\\\\"next_start\\\\\\\":50,\\\\\\\"omissions\\\\\\\":[],\\\\\\\"omitted_cards\\\\\\\":1,\\\\\\\"source_id\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"S1\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"start\\\\\\\":26,\\\\\\\"total_lines\\\\\\\":205,\\\\\\\"v\\\\\\\":3,\\\\\\\"view_id\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"6e752039632cbebac84c202e2a7ae77dbf562e8c69a7e0ab6d67011edb1ff6b3\\\\\\\"}\\\",\\\"role\\\":\\\"user\\\"},{\\\"content\\\":\\\"{\\\\n  \\\\\\\"action\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"ultima_work_research_inspect\\\\\\\",\\\\n  \\\\\\\"action_input\\\\\\\": {\\\\n    \\\\\\\"source_id\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"S1\\\\\\\",\\\\n    \\\\\\\"start_line\\\\\\\": 50\\\\n  }\\\\n}\\\",\\\"role\\\":\\\"assistant\\\"},{\\\"content\\\":\\\"Observation: {\\\\\\\"cards\\\\\\\":[[\\\\\\\"N3.321fae92e927b605\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"documented\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\",51,51,50,55],[\\\\\\\"N3.20445d93058eced7\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"documented\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\",53,53,50,57],[\\\\\\\"N3.202e446db2af740c\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"documented\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\",55,58,53,60],[\\\\\\\"N3.123cc50ccab7bae0\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"documented\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\",59,59,56,63],[\\\\\\\"N3.3718e5a6f9c08d94\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"documented\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\",61,61,58,65],[\\\\\\\"N3.0a8790f1ba880368\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"documented\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\",63,63,60,67],[\\\\\\\"N3.2e8143d3b69c0b73\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"documented\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\",65,65,62,69],[\\\\\\\"N3.c05a481a95fb82cf\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"documented\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\",67,70,65,72]],\\\\\\\"end\\\\\\\":73,\\\\\\\"lines\\\\\\\":[[50,\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\"],[51,\\\\\\\"---\\\\\\\"],[52,\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\"],[53,\\\\\\\"## Download\\\\\\\"],[54,\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\"],[55,\\\\\\\"| Platform | Link |\\\\\\\"],[56,\\\\\\\"|----------|------|\\\\\\\"],[57,\\\\\\\"| 🍎 **Mac** (Apple Silicon) | [Download DMG (M1/M2/M3/M4)](https://github.com/akshayaggarwal99/jarvis-ai-assistant/releases/latest) |\\\\\\\"],[58,\\\\\\\"| 💻 **Mac** (Intel) | [Download DMG (x64)](https://github.com/akshayaggarwal99/jarvis-ai-assistant