e | **Yes (MIT)** | No |\\\"],[72,\\\"| 📡 Telemetry | **None** | ??? |\\\"],[73,\\\"| 👨‍💻 Built by | **1 guy at 2am** | VC money |\\\"]],\\\"next_start\\\":74,\\\"omissions\\\":[],\\\"omitted_cards\\\":1,\\\"source_id\\\":\\\"S1\\\",\\\"start\\\":50,\\\"total_lines\\\":205,\\\"v\\\":3,\\\"view_id\\\":\\\"236e3e169e9d29f9298a13da6d5f2d57fd2003a8767dbe888117d3d8e2c2862e\\\"}\",\"role\":\"user\"},{\"content\":\"{\\n  \\\"action\\\": \\\"ultima_work_research_inspect\\\",\\n  \\\"action_input\\\": {\\n    \\\"source_id\\\": \\\"S1\\\",\\n    \\\"start_line\\\": 74\\n  }\\n}\",\"role\":\"assistant\"},{\"content\":\"Observation: {\\\"cards\\\":[[\\\"N3.5c5e9f7ce3d84d7c\\\",\\\"documented\\\",\\\"\\\",75,75,74,79],[\\\"N3.1da205972f299f86\\\",\\\"documented\\\",\\\"\\\",77,77,74,81],[\\\"N3.ad1ed2a58011fa74\\\",\\\"documented\\\",\\\"\\\",79,82,77,84],[\\\"N3.b9414159109d70a7\\\",\\\"documented\\\",\\\"\\\",83,86,81,88],[\\\"N3.3d3f85c70931eb16\\\",\\\"documented\\\",\\\"\\\",88,88,85,92],[\\\"N3.d1240040db9906a1\\\",\\\"documented\\\",\\\"\\\",90,90,87,94],[\\\"N3.5b666bfc974c4f05\\\",\\\"documented\\\",\\\"\\\",92,92,89,96],[\\\"N3.d92b3e02711dcbd9\\\",\\\"documented\\\",\\\"\\\",94,94,91,97]],\\\"end\\\":97,\\\"lines\\\":[[74,\\\"\\\"],[75,\\\"---\\\"],[76,\\\"\\\"],[77,\\\"## Quick setup (30 seconds)\\\"],[78,\\\"\\\"],[79,\\\"1. Download & open the app\\\"],[80,\\\"2. **Go Local (Recommended for privacy):**  \\\"],[81,\\\"   - Settings → Transcription → Enable **Local Model**\\\"],[82,\\\"   - Choose **Whisper** (tiny/base/small) or **Parakeet** (NVIDIA's 600M param model)\\\"],[83,\\\"   - Settings → AI Models → Enable **Ollama** (requires [Ollama](https://ollama.com) installed)\\\"],[84,\\\"3. **Or Go Cloud (Recommended for speed/accuracy):**\\\"],[85,\\\"   - Paste free Deepgram + Gemini keys\\\"],[86,\\\"4. Hold Fn and talk\\\"],[87,\\\"\\\"],[88,\\\"That's literally it.\\\"],[89,\\\"\\\"],[90,\\\"---\\\"],[91,\\\"\\\"],[92,\\\"## 🦙 Ollama (Local LLM) Support\\\"],